## Instructions

For each work experience role:
1. Generate an appropriate number of bullets (3-8 range based on role complexity)
   - Senior/lead roles with long tenure: 6-8 bullets
   - Mid-level roles: 4-6 bullets
   - Junior roles or short tenure: 3-4 bullets
2. Use STAR method internally: Situation, Task, Action, Result
3. Include quantifiable metrics when available from CV
4. Focus on achievements, not just responsibilities

